yserver (1.7.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.7.1.
    - Fix a GPU hang and slowness with antialiased shapes and gradients on
      slow GPUs (GTK file chooser).
    - RENDER text no longer loses glyphs in long sessions.
    - Windows uncovered by raise, move or close are redrawn like on Xorg.
    - KDE Plasma stale highlights; XSendEvent to windows using XI2.

 -- Jos Dehaes <jos.dehaes@gmail.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

yserver (1.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.7.0.
    - CDE and old-style Motif/Xaw apps work and start fast.
    - One XInput device per mouse, keyboard and touchpad.
    - Runs on Vulkan 1.2 GPUs (Intel Haswell, Ivy Bridge).
    - Fractional scaling, rotation and virtual monitors via RANDR; RECORD.
    - VRAM growth and compositing fixes.

 -- Jos Dehaes <jos.dehaes@gmail.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0200

yserver (1.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.6.0.
    - XDMCP, TCP transport and server reset for shared desktops, both
      off by default at build time.
    - Resize/damage, border and Composite correctness fixes.
    - GLX visual fixes for QtWebEngine and glmark2.
    - RANDR CRTC mode hotplug relight.

 -- Jos Dehaes <jos.dehaes@gmail.com>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

